


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_d6af51e4:



    voice "2SA_0565"
    sachiko "「都说啦，直接进来就行了——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_e7638072:


    "懒洋洋的祥子露出脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_b9465930:



    voice "2MI_0678"
    miyako "「对不起，手上有东西开不了门——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_73ea9cbb:


    "站在房门前的圣夜子边说边举起了两手抬着的锅。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_9d0ab031:



    voice "2MI_0679"
    miyako "「晚上好。我过来分给你一些今天的晚饭」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_55365eef:



    voice "2SA_0566"
    sachiko "「啊……嗯……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_ea394203:



    voice "2MI_0680"
    miyako "「是鸡肉和土豆的烘焙锅。记得加热以后再吃」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_376ff6a3:



    voice "2SA_0567"
    sachiko "「平时都是文送过来的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_4abec3ee:


    "祥子从圣夜子手上接过锅询问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_9d9d252f:



    voice "2MI_0681"
    miyako "「文要洗东西，所以拜托我把这个送来」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_21dd579a:



    voice "2SA_0568"
    sachiko "「这样啊……爱管闲事」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_d01bc088:



    voice "2MI_0682"
    miyako "「？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_2d48d5df:



    voice "2SA_0569"
    sachiko "「代我谢谢文。锅洗好了会还回去的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_024d2114:



    voice "2MI_0683"
    miyako "「很好吃哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_f074a2b4:


    "即使看到祥子打算回屋，圣夜子仍然不介意地搭话。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_3bb96848:



    voice "2SA_0570"
    sachiko "「是啊，毕竟是文做的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_cdbc7da4:



    voice "2MI_0684"
    miyako "「你喜欢吃哪种肉？啊，从牛肉、猪肉、鸡肉里面选一个吧。其他的我还没吃过」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_0fe772d8:



    voice "2SA_0571"
    sachiko "「……猪肉。因为感觉平均值很高」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_fabc2e64:



    voice "2MI_0685"
    miyako "「平均值？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_5ae34a4a:



    voice "2SA_0572"
    sachiko "「贵的肉不管是哪种都很好吃。但价格一般吃起来也好吃的只有猪肉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_4b8d5dcb:



    voice "2MI_0686"
    miyako "「原来如此。贵的肉好吃……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_9ca86342:



    voice "2SA_0573"
    sachiko "「你怎么只听前半句？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_9f653a32:



    voice "2MI_0687"
    miyako "「你至今为止一定吃过各种各样不同的肉吧。真羡慕啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_6e49c32b:



    voice "2SA_0574"
    sachiko "「想让我请客吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_6d713131:


    "想吃一次用别人的钱买的肉。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_4e9ac834:



    voice "2MI_0688"
    miyako "「不是。只是想你果然知道许多东西啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_0889fd5a:



    voice "2SA_0575"
    sachiko "「也就只有几年的量啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_a9c60db6:



    voice "2MI_0689"
    miyako "「希望你从今往后也能教我各种各样的事」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_e9f12681:


    "虽然圣夜子一直开心地继续着谈话，但祥子这边看起来已经渐渐低迷了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_70d9fc6a:



    voice "2SA_0576"
    sachiko "「……像雏鸟一样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_4db1c264:



    voice "2MI_0690"
    miyako "「雏鸟？啊，是说鸭仔蛋吗，我没有吃过。好吃吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_9f8647b0:


    "鸭仔蛋指的是把即将孵化的鸭蛋——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_7f43ab88:



    voice "2SA_0577"
    sachiko "「不是说这个。听说过印随行为吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_1761ef3e:



    voice "2MI_0691"
    miyako "「刚孵出来的幼鸟会跟着看到的第一个会动的东西走——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_2944e517:



    voice "2SA_0578"
    sachiko "「印刻效应。你之所以亲近我，只是因为这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_a3349b74:



    voice "2MI_0692"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_47e1f8cb:


    "哎呀呀这说的还真是伤人。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_662895bd:



    voice "2SA_0579"
    sachiko "「所以那份好感——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_dbae4207:



    voice "2MI_0693"
    miyako "「啊哈哈，或许是吧。成为人类后看到的第一个会动的东西确实是你」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_2e5cdcec:


    "圣夜子安然地笑了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_5d405e87:



    voice "2MI_0694"
    miyako "「即使一开始是因为印随行为也无所谓。毕竟培养起来的这份感情并不是虚假的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_d27169b0:



    voice "2MI_0695"
    miyako "「你肯定也至今珍视着将你引导至地上的某人」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_cb01e345:


    "祥子移开了视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_71c780e4:



    voice "2MI_0696"
    miyako "「是个漂亮的人吗？因为你很执着于外表啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_51b65385:



    voice "2SA_0580"
    sachiko "「……非常漂亮呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_f55d737f:



    voice "2MI_0697"
    miyako "「果然。但是这样我就有点放心了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_bfe9157e:



    voice "2SA_0581"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_0d723aab:



    voice "2MI_0698"
    miyako "「如果那个人就在附近的话，对我来说也是非常——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_dda00239:



    voice "2SA_0582"
    sachiko "「闭嘴——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_1c01764c:


    "走廊回响着祥子暴躁的声音，最后回归紧绷的静寂。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_bab00f09:



    voice "2MI_0699"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_46b3fb78:


    "突然的愤怒让圣夜子呆在了原地。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_924d331d:



    voice "2SA_0583"
    sachiko "「抱、抱歉！突然发出那么大的声音。吓了一跳吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_edd3707e:


    "祥子很快回过神来。慌张地露出尴尬的笑容，合起手请求着原谅，打着圆场。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_2709e034:



    voice "2MI_0700"
    miyako "「不……那个」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_f346ab2b:



    voice "2SA_0584"
    sachiko "「今天有点急躁……不知道是不是气压的原因。身体状态可能也不是很好。真的很抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_051487e8:



    voice "2MI_0701"
    miyako "「我才是对不起。明明走廊很冷还和你说这么久话」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_0ac6b881:



    voice "2SA_0585"
    sachiko "「啊……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_2e8bd591:


    "圣夜子突然伸出手摸了摸祥子的额头。记住祥子的热度后又把手心朝着自己额头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_49e6e1d4:



    voice "2MI_0702"
    miyako "「好像差不多。应该没有发烧……大概。啊，果然还是不太清楚，因为是第一次」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_811d8f8e:



    voice "2SA_0586"
    sachiko "「什么啊那是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_4b10395a:



    voice "2MI_0703"
    miyako "「但确实可能会感冒的，所以睡前一定要暖暖身子」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_f112bd53:



    voice "2SA_0587"
    sachiko "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_3e4d2227:



    voice "2MI_0704"
    miyako "「那么晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_7ad8997a:


    "圣夜子快速低了下头，哆嗦着走回了自己的房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_dd292790:



    voice "2SA_0588"
    sachiko "「…………哎真是的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_82613119:


    "祥子关上门，用额头抵住门呻吟。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_88522e86:


    "印随行为和一般的学习过程不同，有不可逆而难以去除的特点。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_07_f7ddca81:


    "孵化后的幼鸟，如果看到人、动物或者物体而追过去的话，就会这么跟随一生。"
